1
00:00:00,223 --> 00:00:04,433
(Sheldon:)No. The X-Men were named
for the X in Charles Xavier.

2
00:00:04,603 --> 00:00:08,903
(Sheldon:)Since I am Sheldon Cooper,
you will be my C-Men.

3
00:00:14,237 --> 00:00:16,067
(Howard:)Oh, that's not a good name.

4
00:00:18,742 --> 00:00:20,742
[TRANQUIL INDIAN MUSIC
PLAYING OVER SPEAKER]

5
00:00:26,708 --> 00:00:29,548
(Raj:)These methods come
from the ancient gurus of India...

6
00:00:29,711 --> 00:00:32,881
(Raj:)...and have helped me
overcome my own fears.

7
00:00:34,216 --> 00:00:37,096
(Sheldon:)And yet you can't speak to women.

8
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:39,550
(Raj:)But thanks to meditation...

9
00:00:39,721 --> 00:00:43,391
...I'm able to stay in the same room
with them without urinating.

10
00:00:45,769 --> 00:00:48,559
Now, ahem, close your eyes.

11
00:00:48,730 --> 00:00:51,400
(Sheldon:)Okay, but don't punch me.

12
00:00:51,942 --> 00:00:54,822
(Leonard:)-What?
-When I was little my sister would say:

13
00:00:55,028 --> 00:00:56,948
"Close your eyes,
you'll get a surprise."

14
00:00:57,113 --> 00:00:59,023
(Sheldon:)And then she'd punch me.

